# Campaign sync

- **Single source of truth:** `src/data/campaigns.js` (+ helpers in `src/lib/business/campaigns.js`).
- **Never** hardcode promo package prices in FAQ answers, the system prompt, or UI copy — read from campaign data.
- **Authority split:** the active campaign (packages, Hot Tuesday, or a single offer) → campaigns.js; ordinary services → live admin catalog (`catalogContext.js`).
- When changing a campaign, update `campaigns.js` only; assistant grounding (`campaignContext.js`), the home `CampaignPoster`, and `/offers` pick it up automatically.
- After campaign edits, run `npm run test:run` (campaign + campaignContext tests).
- See `docs/CAMPAIGNS.md`.
